\tag{fnip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{The eigenspaces match the time behavior}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{The stable and unstable eigenspaces of the
[linearization](fnip-0034) are the flat sets with this time
behavior. A state in the stable eigenspace approaches the
equilibrium, and a state in the unstable eigenspace leaves it.
The [local stable manifold](fnip-0044) and the
[local unstable manifold](fnip-0044) are the sets of the nonlinear
velocity with that time behavior.}
